{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-explainer-about-sonic-the-hedgehog-what-the-game-is-fast-side-scrolling-platform-game-b/audio/main-8bd675b68d4f.mp3","durationSec":217.536,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.78,"text":"**Sonic the Hedgehog** is a fast platform game from 1991."},{"start":4.56,"end":8.1,"text":"A platform game asks you to move and jump across places on the screen."},{"start":8.56,"end":10.36,"text":"It is also side-scrolling."},{"start":10.36,"end":13.56,"text":"This means the view moves sideways as you travel through the level."},{"start":14.56,"end":17.12,"text":"You control a blue hedgehog who runs at high speed."},{"start":17.68,"end":21.32,"text":"You collect rings and try to stop **Doctor Robotnik**, the main enemy."},{"start":21.32,"end":24.54,"text":"**Doctor Eggman** is this enemy’s name in Japan."},{"start":25.3,"end":30.18,"text":"The blue hedgehog is also the famous mascot of **Sega**, a Japanese video game company."},{"start":30.18,"end":33,"text":"A mascot is a character that represents a company."},{"start":33.7,"end":35.7,"text":"You run and jump to move through the game."},{"start":36.48,"end":38.02,"text":"Jumping also lets Sonic attack."},{"start":38.6,"end":40.2,"text":"He curls into a ball and spins."},{"start":40.9,"end":42.62,"text":"He can roll into a ball on the ground, too."},{"start":43.36,"end":44.86,"text":"This move is called a **Spin Attack**."},{"start":45.44,"end":46.66,"text":"It helps him defeat enemies."},{"start":47.42,"end":49.8,"text":"The gold circles you collect are called **rings**."},{"start":50.54,"end":51.76,"text":"They help protect Sonic."},{"start":52.24,"end":55.98,"text":"When an enemy hits him, he drops his rings instead of losing a life."},{"start":56.44,"end":58.1,"text":"You can try to collect some again."},{"start":58.96,"end":62.1,"text":"With no rings, getting hit by an enemy can cost him a life."},{"start":63.14,"end":65.02,"text":"Speed helps, but rings matter too."},{"start":66.66,"end":68.52,"text":"The game has different areas called zones."},{"start":69.22,"end":71.62,"text":"**Green Hill Zone** is the famous first level."},{"start":72.2,"end":74.06,"text":"It has green hills and loops."},{"start":74.96,"end":77.36,"text":"A loop is a path that goes around in a circle."},{"start":77.36,"end":80.44,"text":"Sonic can run through these loops at high speed."},{"start":80.44,"end":83.42,"text":"Later zones give you different places to explore."},{"start":83.89,"end":86.14,"text":"At the end of many zones, you meet a boss."},{"start":86.14,"end":89.4,"text":"A boss is a strong enemy in a special fight."},{"start":90.16,"end":92.5,"text":"You need to watch its movements and attack carefully."},{"start":93.38,"end":99.84,"text":"There are also **Chaos Emeralds**, special gems you can collect in special stages outside the main zones."},{"start":99.84,"end":104.88,"text":"**Sonic Team**, a game-making team at Sega, developed the original game."},{"start":105.84,"end":106.68,"text":"Sega published it."},{"start":107.02,"end":109.84,"text":"It came out for the **Sega Genesis**, a home game console."},{"start":110.64,"end":113.54,"text":"**Mega Drive** is the console’s name outside North America."},{"start":114.36,"end":119.62,"text":"The game arrived in North America and PAL regions, including Europe, in June 1991."},{"start":120.54,"end":123.62,"text":"It arrived in Japan on July 26, 1991."},{"start":124.9,"end":129,"text":"In the United States, Sega included the Genesis as pack-in with the console."},{"start":129.9,"end":132.76,"text":"This pack-in copy helped many people start with Sonic."},{"start":133.5,"end":138.94,"text":"Including those pack-in copies, it sold over 15 million copies on the Sega Genesis."},{"start":139.84,"end":145.24,"text":"This first game started a huge franchise, a family of related games and other products."},{"start":146.22,"end":151.28,"text":"The original 1991 game is the famous first classic at the center of Sonic’s story."},{"start":152.02,"end":155.16,"text":"When people talk about classic Sonic, they often mean this game."},{"start":155.74,"end":160.56,"text":"Its first green level, gold rings, and fast movement are important parts of that picture."},{"start":161.02,"end":162.04,"text":"These parts work together."},{"start":162.72,"end":163.86,"text":"Speed makes running exciting."},{"start":163.86,"end":167.2,"text":"Rings give you a reason to look around and collect things."},{"start":167.92,"end":171.08,"text":"Hills and loops make the path more interesting than a straight road."},{"start":171.08,"end":174.02,"text":"You do not only run as fast as possible."},{"start":174.52,"end":178.94,"text":"You also choose when to jump, when to collect rings, and when to slow down."},{"start":178.94,"end":183,"text":"**Sonic the Hedgehog 2** came out in 1992."},{"start":184.12,"end":185.2,"text":"Many more games followed."},{"start":185.94,"end":187.64,"text":"Together, they became a large series."},{"start":188.66,"end":193.12,"text":"Sonic grew from the star of one game into a character known far beyond that first release."},{"start":193.84,"end":197.8,"text":"Still, the 1991 original is the famous first flagship."},{"start":198.78,"end":201.74,"text":"A flagship is a leading product that helps people know a company."},{"start":202.52,"end":205.6,"text":"You do not need to know every later game to understand this classic."},{"start":206.34,"end":213.82,"text":"Start with its main ideas: a blue hedgehog, fast movement, jumping, rings, and an enemy to stop."},{"start":214.16,"end":217.02,"text":"That gives you a clear picture of where the series began."}],"words":[{"text":"Sonic","start":0,"end":0.4},{"text":"the","start":0.4,"end":0.58},{"text":"Hedgehog","start":0.58,"end":1.06},{"text":"is","start":1.06,"end":1.38},{"text":"a","start":1.38,"end":1.54},{"text":"fast","start":1.54,"end":1.86},{"text":"platform","start":1.86,"end":2.38},{"text":"game","star